{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "39d5a00e-5dca-872f-9fdc-4fd4d3c4ddff",
  "created_at": "2026-01-12T16:06:59-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Yesenia Quintero",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T16:05:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T16:05:04-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon, Mr. Kevin. My name is Yesenia Quintero. I have a question about the recycling, please. What can go inside now? I am not sure about the pizza boxes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T16:05:14-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, pizza boxes. Go ahead, I'm writing this down as we go."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T16:05:19-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, thank you. The pizza boxes, and also the glass, the jars. And the plastic containers with the lid that closes, the clamshells, for the fruit. Can I put these?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T16:05:29-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So pizza box, glass, clamshells. Generally clean and dry is the rule. A pizza box with a lot of grease on it usually can't go in, but the clean top part can. Glass jars are fine, rinsed. Clamshells, those are usually accepted if they're empty and clean. I can mail you the current list too if you want it on paper."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T16:05:49-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that would be very good for me. The paper is better. And one more thing, please. My blue bin, it is cracked after the storm, the one that ended Saturday. How do I ask for a new one, a replacement?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T16:06:02-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can put in a request for that. What's the location?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T16:06:07-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is three five eight Bellevue Avenue. Three, five, eight. [pause] Hello? Mr. Kevin?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T16:06:12-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello? Ma'am, you there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T16:06:14-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am sorry, I am sorry. The line, it fell. I called again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T16:06:19-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all, it happens. I've got you at 358 Bellevue Avenue for a replacement recycling bin, cracked. Is it the blue one with the lid?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T16:06:28-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the blue one, with the lid. The lid is also broken, a little."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T16:06:33-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, bin and lid. And the best number for you is the one you're calling from?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T16:06:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, four zero one, five five five, zero one six five."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T16:06:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. I'll send the request over and mail the recycling list to the same address. Anything else today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T16:06:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you very much for your help, Mr. Kevin. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T16:06:56-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Ms. Quintero. Take care."
    }
  ],
